`s 391(a)(16) the most that may be charged for a written report of a record search` MEANS 200

-- src:2052 | (17) For preclearance of any document for filing, a fee of $350 shall be paid, with the exception of documents for filing under § 204 of this title, for which a fee of $1,500 shall be paid.
-- Gloss: $350 for preclearance of a document for filing; $1,500 where the document is one for filing under § 204 (piece dg4).
