`s 391(a)(20) the fee on the documents prescribed in § 389(c)` MEANS 10_000

-- src:2056 | (21) For receiving, reviewing and filing and/or indexing by the Secretary of State of the documents prescribed in § 389(d) of this title, an annual fee of $2,500 shall be paid.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 391(a)(21) (src:2056)
