`s 391(a)(21) the annual fee on the documents prescribed in § 389(d)` MEANS 2_500

-- src:2057 | (22) Except as provided in this section, the fees of the Secretary of State shall be as provided for in § 2315 of Title 29.
-- out of range: § 2315 of Title 29 (not among the inputs): the fee it provides is a plain input.
